Implemented `--group-by-category` with filtering before grouping, category-sorted JSON, summed quantities, and exact decimal stock values formatted as two-digit fractional strings.

Ungrouped output is preserved. Invalid CSV returns exit code 2 with stderr and no traceback. Processing and argument parsing remain separate. README includes a grouped example and expected output.

All 10 supplied tests pass; tests were unchanged. Additional precision and malformed-CSV checks also passed.
